5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope we can find a plan that doesn’t leave us scrambling at the end.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! I’m really excited to help pick the best plan. Let’s make sure we actually use the new spaces!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I’ve seen too many projects fail because we ignored the people maintaining them. Let’s keep that in mind.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree with George. We must verify if past projects actually served their users well before committing new funds.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. We should ensure the numbers we approve actually match the reality of what we build.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Benjamin"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Benjamin: Agreed. We should ensure the numbers we approve actually match the reality of what we build.""}]}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I worry about schedules slipping. @Benjamin, do the tender records show consistent delays?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Shizue, I’d love to check the timetable records! Knowing how long rooms stay out of service helps us plan better.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"@Yumi, those records are useful, but I’m more concerned about the staffing posts. We need to know if we have the people to maintain this.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@George, staffing is vital, but we must also check post-occupancy reviews. We need to know if previous projects actually satisfied the people using them.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mizuki, post-occupancy reviews are vital, but they often ignore the hidden costs that emerge after the ribbon is cut.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, you’re right. I’ll look into the tender records and the delivery schedules to see where the time goes.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I’ll check the timetable records and booking data! I want to see how much space is actually used after the work finishes.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I’ll examine the staffing posts and the bench technicians’ weekly routines. We must understand the current burden before adding more.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I’ll review the post-occupancy ratings and the survey findings in the older blocks. We need to know what actually worked for users.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll examine the renewal reserve and the tender records. I need to see where the budget actually goes once the ink dries.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,Thank you all. I’m glad we’re looking at the right things. Let’s see what the records tell us.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I’m so happy we’re all on the same page! Let’s see what the data reveals.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,"Quietly, I’ll review the staffing posts and the bench technicians’ weekly routines. We must understand the current burden before adding more.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I’m glad we’re aligning on user satisfaction. Let’s see what the data reveals.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,A pleasant consensus. I’ll see what the numbers whisper when the applause fades.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
